	quests: [
		{
			description: [
				"Welcome to your first day on the job at BanksCo. I am Mr. Banks himself and I am pleased to welcome you to our great and wonderful business. HR will onboard you on the company culture and start assigning you some tasks. Until then I look forward to you making me tons of money!"
				""
				"Note for actual modpack mechanics, this is not a hardcore pack, more of a progression pack, one could probably ignore the questbook and be fine. Some mods are packed with others in the questbook, but you still have the freedom of choice to do what mods you want to play with."
				""
				"Note: These mods are planned for future content updates, play with the current config at your own risk:"
				"Fossils and Archeology"
				"Bloody Hell!"
				"Forestry"
				"Ars Nouveau"
				"Forbidden Arcanus"
				"Occultism"
			]
			id: "1C29C4A50DAF3F4B"
			rewards: [{
				id: "7DC6C1ADEFA53B99"
